  "chapter": "ssc-higher-math-chapter-02-model-test-03",
  "text": "যদি $m+n=9$ এবং $m^2+n^2=53$ হয়, তবে $mn$ এর মান কত?",
  "options": ["12", "14", "16", "18"],
  "answer": "14",
  "answerIndex": 1,
  "explanation": "$(m+n)^2=m^2+n^2+2mn$। তাই $81=53+2mn \Rightarrow 2mn=28 \Rightarrow mn=14$।",
  "image": null,
